    <string name="set_b_sync_limits">• Both boxes must be on, with IMD TV open or used recently.\n• A follower gets the master\'s changes the next time it opens IMD TV (or within 6 hours) while the master can be reached.\n• Changes made on a follower are replaced at its next sync.\n• Logins are sent only to boxes you pair, on this network.</string>
    <string name="set_b_master_steps">This box is now the master. To add a follower, go to the other box:\n1. On the other box, open IMD TV › Settings › Backup &amp; sync › Sync.\n2. Set Role to Follower, then choose Turn on and OK.\n3. Still on the other box, choose Master, then pick this box from the list.\n4. A six-digit code appears on this screen. Type it on the other box and choose Pair.\nRepeat for as many boxes as you like; they\'re listed here under Followers.</string>
    <string name="set_b_follower_steps">This box is now a follower. To pair it:\n1. On the box to copy, open IMD TV › Settings › Backup &amp; sync › Sync and set Role to Master.\n2. Back on this box, choose Master, then pick that box from the list.\n3. A six-digit code appears on that box\'s screen. Type it here and choose Pair.\nThis box then copies the master each time IMD TV opens and every 6 hours.</string>
